{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1222102-spreading-the-luminous-teachings","id":1222102,"title":"Spreading the Luminous Teachings","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-05-25T12:04:29-07:00","id":1222102,"title":"Spreading the Luminous Teachings","content":"So, in a few months I will be moving, either to another state or another country.<br /> <br /> While this will be great professionally, it also means I will move away from my friends, family and the games we enjoy together.<br /> <br /> So, in one of those games, we play a Circle of heavily Lore based characters who after conquering a distant SW corner of Creation are setting out to the Wyld to Wyld Shape a world/continent land out of it. I hope we can play this part of the game before I move away.<br /> <br /> In paralel I was thinking of how to setup a new game so me and my wife can still enjoy the hobby. So I was thinking of using an idea I had for that game and turn it into the start of this one.<br /> <br /> In this new Chronicle, said Circle of Solar Sages succeeded in their objective and the characters (one for me and one for my wife, we will alternate playing and STing, will be her first ST experience) are part of this vanguard to the new world. The brand new, savage frontier kind of world will be good for easening the setting knowledge burden for my wife, and let us just come up with whatever we want without feeling like we're trampling the setting. Letting us approach combat/social encounters with native spirits, mortals... Explore for natural treasures, building places of power etc...<br /> <br /> Now for some ideas;<br /> <br /> - This will be a DB game. Or maybe mortal, I still haven't figured it out quite yet.<br /> <br /> - I was thinking of letting each character choose a Solar Patron, and be able to benefit from being the target of Lore Teaching Charms.<br /> <br /> Each Solar Patron would have a set of Attributes, Abilities, Spells, Martial Arts (+Charms) and Merits that they teach. They would also have a set of Intimacies that are transmitted through these teachings.<br /> <br /> At character creation you can choose to adopt these intimacies and gain extra bonus points for doing so:<br /> <br /> Each Intimacy at Minor intensity is 1 BP, at Major will be 2 BP, and at Defining, 3 BP. (Or 3, 6 and 9XP, for alternative CC and/or later lessons as rewards for missions accomplished).<br /> <br /> The more Intimacies you take, and the more intense they are, point to the amount of exposure you had to these Solars, and probably the more of their gaze you're attracting.<br /> <br /> I'm also thinking of the Presence follower enhancing Charms, and giving them as power-ups/rewards for certain missions.<br /> <br /> - I'm thinking of creating QC version of the Solars, to be used as &quot;Eidolons/Summons/Guardian Forces&quot;, the characters could use in emergencies, though they would have no way of knowing what the Solar decides to do, or even if they will show up at all, or how long it would take for them to arrive. Still no very sure of this part. <br /> <br /> - The organizations/cults for each Patron, could lend Artifacts, Retainers, Battlegroups...<br /> <br /> - Any DB will start with Influence 1. If they chosse to join a Patron's organization they get Mentor 3, Backing 2-3.<br /> <br /> How close to the Sun are you willing to go? How much of their power will you drink? How far would you go to stay on their good graces?<br /> <br /> Do you agree with their aims (the ones you know of, anyways)?<br /> <br /> If you don't, how do you get away? How do you oppose them? They seem to know when you waiver, just by looking at you... They can hear when you whisper their names...<br /> <br /> So, to wrap this up... What do you all think?<br /> <br /> I can see this going a few ways in the beggining.<br /> <br /> 1. Characters partake fully of Solar power. They are part of the elite of the expedition force. They are important to, and under the scrutiny of, the Solars. They can embrace this and be Conquering Champions, taming the land in the name of their Lords (Gods?) Do they chafe under the (oppressive?) weight of Celestial Might? How about if/when their Teacher/God/King/Lover act irrationally (Great Curse) and terrible things happen?<br /> <br /> This can start with characters flexing their power and pull with the Expedition. It can keep on going with power fantasy as long as its fun. It shift to fear/paranoia, greed/envy, disappointment/betrayal, etc...<br /> <br /> 2. Characters were part of the expedition, but didn't fully buy into the whole propaganda. They participated, even heroically, at The Battle of the World's Birth, but kept themselves at the margin of the Solar movement. Now they find themselves in a very isolated, foreign world. Surrounded by fanatics and their Gods. Things seem to be going well. THe true believers are geting powerful and rewarded, people are starting to question why you don't show up for the lessons and speeches...<br /> <br /> Will the characters be tempted to join one of the cults? Will they try to maintain their distance to further explore this new world and maybe seize a good opportunity? Will they try to find their way back to Creation? Will THEY let them flee?<br /> <br /> Anyways, this is enough rambling for the first brainstorming session. Thanks for any input you may contribute! I will keep a watch","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2746-tgueiros","name":"TGUEIROS","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2746_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1393"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-26T15:03:11-07:00","id":1222314,"title":"","content":"This all sounds pretty cool. I do think that, if you're going to be swapping ST duties with your wife you should definitely involve her in the brainstorming.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-27T08:05:35-07:00","id":1222421,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BrilliantRain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1222102-spreading-the-luminous-teachings?p=1222314#post1222314\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This all sounds pretty cool. I do think that, if you're going to be swapping ST duties with your wife you should definitely involve her in the brainstorming.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh for sure!<br /> <br /> I'm just working out of town, and was at work procrastinating and wanted to kill time. Also this is pretty low on our &quot;things to talk about&quot; list. With all the travelling I've been doing and the moving far away prospects.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2746-tgueiros","name":"TGUEIROS","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2746_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1393"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}